{"ref":"BDB, רֶ֫שֶׁף","hw":"רֶ֫שֶׁף","html":"† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">רֶ֫שֶׁף</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 3:5\" href=\"/Habakkuk.3.5\">Hb 3:5</a></sup> <strong>flame, fire-bolt</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:24\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.24\">Dt 32:24</a> +; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">רְשָׁפִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:48\" href=\"/Psalms.78.48\">ψ 78:48</a>, cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">רִשְׁפֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 76:4\" href=\"/Psalms.76.4\">76:4</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">רִשְׁפֵּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 8:6\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.8.6\">Ct 8:6</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">רְשָׁפֶיהָ</span> v <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 8:6\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.8.6\">6</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>flame:</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳ ר׳ אֵשׁ</span> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 8:6\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.8.6\">Ct 8:6</a> <em>its flames</em> (sc. of <span dir=\"rtl\">אַהֲבָה</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">קִנְאָה</span>) <em>are flames of fire;</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּנֵי ר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 5:7\" href=\"/Job.5.7\">Jb 5:7</a> = <em>sparks;</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳</span> = pointed <em>flame</em> of lightning <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:48\" href=\"/Psalms.78.48\">ψ 78:48</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">בָּרָד</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳ קָ֑שֶׁת</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 76:4\" href=\"/Psalms.76.4\">76:4</a> sharp <em>flames of the bow</em>, fig. for arrows.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>fire-bolt</em> of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>, bringing pestilence and death, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:24\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.24\">Dt 32:24</a> (cf. Dr; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">קֶטֶב מְרִירִי</span>), <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 3:5\" href=\"/Habakkuk.3.5\">Hb 3:5</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">דֶּבֶר</span>).","next":"BDB, רֶ֫שֶׁף²","prev":"BDB, רשׁף"}